data: {"candidates": [{"content": {"role": "model","parts": [{"thought": true,"text": "**Tracking Gym Routine**\n\nI'm currently tracking the sequence of gym activities, noting specific exercises with free weights. I observed interactions with a workout partner, including demonstrations and shared jokes. I also documented transitions between exercises, like adjusting the bench and racking weights. Now, I am noting the use of dumbbells and observing the activities of the companion. There seems to be a lot of adjustment between tasks.\n\n\n"}]}}],"modelVersion": "gemini-3.1-pro-low","responseId": "nWqiaqa9GpyiqtsP_PmDkAI","usageMetadata":{"promptTokenCount": 9592,"totalTokenCount": 9592}}

data: {"candidates": [{"content": {"role": "model","parts": [{"thought": true,"text": "**Monitoring Gym Observations**\n\nI'm now monitoring detailed gym observations. I've noted mirror reflections, TV content (commercials and news), and specific actions like overhead dumbbell raises and picking up dumbbells. I'm observing a man doing dumbbell rows, a kettlebell rack, and gym TV promotional ads. Furthermore, I've noted observations of people, machines (ab crunch and pivot mechanism), and interactions with a workout partner, including conversations, weight adjustments, and transitions between stations. I'm focusing on the activities of the companion. Finally, I noted that I replaced dumbbells, and followed the companion again.\n\n\n"}]}}],"modelVersion": "gemini-3.1-pro-low","responseId": "nWqiaqa9GpyiqtsP_PmDkAI","usageMetadata":{"promptTokenCount": 9592,"totalTokenCount": 9592}}

